  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Biran Singh vs The State Of Bihar on 29 January, 2013 Author: Dinesh Kumar Singh Bench: Dinesh Kumar Singh In The High Court Of Judicature At Patna Criminal Miscellaneous No.44016 of 2012 ====================================================== Biran Singh son of Dhanesh Singh .... .... Petitione Versus The State Of Bihar .... .... Opposite Party/ ====================================================== Coram: Honourable Mr. Justice Dinesh Kumar Singh Oral Order",
    "facts": "The present anticipatory bail application has been filed since anticipatory bail application was pending before learned Sessions Judge vide A.B.P. No. 01 of 2012. The report of the learned Sessions Judge suggests that A.B.P. No. 01 of 2012 relates to one Jugeshwar Prasad registered under Sections 272, 273 of the I.P.C. and 63 and 59(iii) of the Food Safety and Standard Act. Annexure-2 is the photocopy of the certified copy which reflects A.B.P. Number of the petitioner as A.B.P. No. 1 of 2012. There is some mistake in the records of learned Sessions Judge.",
